      },
      "lineNbr": 65,
      "author": {
        "id": 1038645
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-31T22:34:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So, to my understanding the normal touchHLE convention is consts and matches? if that is wrong, please let me know what I should follow, but did it this way now.",
      "parentUuid": "56eecdfe_70ef6564",
      "revId": "56d3c1f6371872d30936f4b49184e1641caa336f",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
